ghuan","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wanghuan:p001","mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wanghuan:p001:m0026","quote":"球"}],"identity_note":"本次固定來源首輪候選；未與全庫同姓或同名者強合。","review":"ai_provisional","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"3c9_d1d_870","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-065","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family","source_id":"s-jinshu-065-wangdao-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family:line102","quote":"初，劉裕爲布衣，眾未之識也，惟謐獨奇貴之，嘗謂裕曰：「卿當爲一代英雄。」及裕破恆玄，謐以本官加侍中，領揚州刺史、録尚書事。謐既受寵桓氏，常不自安。護軍將軍劉毅嘗問謐曰：「璽綬何在？」謐益懼。會王綏以桓氏甥自疑，謀反，父子兄弟皆伏誅。謐從弟諶，少驍果輕俠，欲誘謐還呉，起兵爲亂，乃説謐曰：「王綏無罪，而義旗誅之，是除時望也。兄少立名譽，加位地如此，欲不危，得乎！」謐懼而出奔。劉裕箋詣大將軍、武陵王遵，遣人追躡，謐既還，委任如先，加謐班劍二十人。義熙三年卒，時年四十八。追贈侍中、司徒，諡曰文恭。三子：瓘、球、琇。入宋，皆至大官。","source_term":"三子：瓘、球、琇"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-jinshu065-phase3-011","interpretation_note":"謐傳明列三子，字母非排行；保留父親現ID，不擅遷號。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}},{"id":"q7m_r8k_2vn","label":"王僧朗","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"僧朗","mention_ids":["c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan:p001:m0014"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-049","source_id":"s-nanqishu-049-ws2261984-wanghuan","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan:p001","mention_id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan:p001:m0014","quote":"僧朗"}],"review":"ai_provisional"},{"id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_A","label":"王粹","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"粹","mention_ids":["c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan:p001:m0026","c-nanshi-023-wanghuan:p001:m0011"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-049","source_id":"s-nanqishu-049-ws2261984-wanghuan","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan:p001","mention_id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan:p001:m0026","quote":"粹"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-ws2478204-wanghuan","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-02